        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"7946b400-a4a3-40da-a6a0-4ee2f7099ccc\",\"review_text\":\"Potangina yung group sessions ayaw na gumana hindi na kami makapag Listen together ni Crush tangina nyo. POTANG INA NYO 2022 NA AYAW PARIN DI NA KAMI NAGKTULUYAN NI CRUSH KO PAKYU\"},{\"review_id\":\"f96e1c75-650b-4e27-ad5b-53c138d57406\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent choice of selection great algorithm and a overall great listening experience.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8baacfda-1531-4610-a915-c5953acd87e2\",\"review_text\":\"😡ethana ads da poduvenga❔🧐\"},{\"review_id\":\"b2db35a9-c73f-4508-9fd8-3ab4fc5582ed\",\"review_text\":\"It sometimes glitches but otherwise it's still the best platform for music listening but premium is definitely recommended.\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc821180-027f-4a8e-97eb-5b1a2937ba5a\",\"review_text\":\"Huwu\"},{\"review_id\":\"7aa4b3a8-ece5-4c1d-837d-e3d7cc398f79\",\"review_text\":\"Fantastic music choice\"},{\"review_id\":\"b0a34080-ad65-40fe-8188-bedfc71b4b80\",\"review_text\":\"its good app\"},{\"review_id\":\"852a9999-0102-4c5b-a099-b705aaed4b7e\",\"review_text\":\"I love but the ads always long like 30 sec it sooooo long\"},{\"review_id\":\"03102040-7e33-4643-91a7-65ec9ed383f9\",\"review_text\":\"Would give a ZERO star if could. Can't play any songs in Playlist or searched songs. Have to tap the song multiple times, but it doesn't always work. I've done all the troubleshooting steps. Uninstalled\\\\reinstalled app. Restart devices. Uninstalled\\\\reinstalled app. Logged out\\\\in. Cleared data\\\\chache Nothing gives a permanent solution. Gonna cancel my subscription because why am I gonna pay for a service that doesn't even work. I am very disappointed after being a loyal customer for many years.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8cec2f3f-6025-414a-b69d-ff700350cc1e\",\"review_text\":\"Ea chutiyo ki add e dekhta raho\"}]}"
